Description: ViewOS default desktop metapackage
 This metapackage pulls in the complete ViewOS desktop environment,
 including KDE Plasma, drivers, firmware, applications, and system
 utilities.
 .
 ViewOS is a Debian-based distribution featuring head-tracked window
 perspective using webcam-based face detection.